Disclaimer:
 The upstream source tree contains pre-built, proprietary Qualcomm Trusted
 Applications (ta/ and mink_platform/mink_test/qtvm_test/prebuilt_qtee_ta/)
 under the Qualcomm.nologin.binaries.license. These signed secure-world
 payloads are not used by the build and are not installed in any binary
 package built from this source. The source tree also contains pre-built
 x86-64 binaries of the Mink IDL compiler (libmink/SDK/QTVM/minkidl and
 libmink/SDK/QTVM/idl/minkidl). They are not used by the build either,
 which uses the mink-idl-compiler package.
